                                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-warning"></i> Yönetici Denetimi
                            </span>
                            <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark fw-bold font-monospace px-2 py-1" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">ADMIN</span>
                        </div>
